{
    "article_summary": "The article describes a silver/chiral pyrrolidinopyridine (PPY) relay catalytic system for the asymmetric cycloisomerization/(2 + 3) cycloaddition of enynamides with MBH carbonates. This method provides efficient access to bispirocyclopentene pyrazolones with high stereoselectivity (up to >19:1 dr, 99.5:0.5 er). The products were found to exhibit isoform-selective PDE1B inhibitory activity, with compound 3x showing therapeutic potential for pulmonary fibrosis.",
